äriä seesaminsiemeniä.","_key":"8bf2e369122f","marks":[]}]}]}]}],"nutritionInfo":{"carbohydratesPer100g":15.623456790123456,"carbohydratesTotal":379.65,"fatPer100g":7.22880658436214,"fatTotal":175.66,"kcalPer100g":145.57201646090536,"kcalTotal":3537.4,"proteinPer100g":3.8065843621399176,"proteinTotal":92.5},"pantryItems":[{"title":"suolaa"},{"title":"mustapippuria"},{"title":"kuivattua timjamia"},{"title":"öljyä"},{"title":"ripaus suolaa"},{"title":"sokeria"},{"title":"valkoviinietikkaa"}],"steps":[{"_key":"9811fb73b6a6","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Kuumenna uuni 225 asteeseen. Vuoraa uunipelti leivinpaperilla.","_key":"af4674a3522d","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"ca11134b497d","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Pese ja pilko perunat pellille. Mausta suolalla, mustapippurilla, kuivatulla timjamilla ja öljyllä. Nosta perunat uuniin ja paahda noin 20 minuuttia.","_key":"22ee26070539","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"aa8ca833a0d8","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Suikaloi valkokaali ohuiksi suikaleiksi kulhoon. Kuori, huuhtele ja raasta porkkana sekaan. Mausta suolalla, sokerilla ja valkoviinietikalla. Sekoita kulhoon yksi pussi vegaanista majoneesia.","_key":"1edcd68980c6","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"d5bd01496b4a","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Sekoita jäljellä oleva vegaaninen majoneesi ja sweet chilikastike pienessä astiassa.","_key":"a150cc9d7992","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"bec5b6da463e","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Kun perunat ovat paahtuneet noin 20 minuuttia, niin lisää vegaaniset nakit pellille. Jatka paahtamista noin 8-10 minuuttia.","_key":"002dfcff38b6","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"b3ee71347e11","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Lämmitä hodarisämpylät esimerkiksi uunissa.","_key":"bd7ae95ff3ac","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"e7fd46fa35cf","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Sivele sämpylöihin majoneesia. Lisää väliin coleslawta ja vegaanisia nakkeja.","_key":"5af54ac2a714","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"9b5b567fce99","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"level":1,"listItem":"number","children":[{"_type":"span","text":"Tarjoile hodarit paahdettujen perunoiden kanssa.","_key":"a95d6f44ae53","marks":[]}]}],"tips":[[{"_key":"170ed301ab20","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","text":"1. Paista nakit paistinpannulla.","_key":"19b09bb76adf","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"a630051e9874","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","text":"2. Jos kastiketta jää yli, voit nauttia sen perunoiden kanssa.","_key":"53e1dfff3a9a","marks":[]}]},{"_key":"fa2262d3c723","_type":"block","style":"normal","markDefs":[],"children":[{"_type":"span","text":"\n","_key":"c2840e639868","marks":[]}]}]]}', '{"preparationTime":35,"serves":4,"allergens":[],"diets":[{"id":"c25c7606-baf0-432e-9513-0194429eb1b5","title":"Vegaaninen"}]}');
